---
const steps = [
	{
		number: '01',
		title: 'Initial Contact',
		description: 'Reach out via email or the online form. We can arrange a brief, informal 15-minute introductory video or phone call to discuss what brings you to therapy and answer any questions.'
	},
	{
		number: '02',
		title: 'First Session',
		description: 'Our first 50-minute video session provides space to explore your background, goals, and concerns in more depth. It is also an opportunity to see how it feels to work together.'
	},
	{
		number: '03',
		title: 'Regular Weekly Sessions',
		description: 'We meet weekly at a dedicated time online via Zoom.'
	},
	{
		number: '04',
		title: 'Ongoing Reviews & Pacing',
		description: 'We periodically review our work together to ensure therapy remains helpful and aligned with your goals, whether you prefer short-term focused work or open-ended exploration.'
	}
];
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="py-14 sm:py-20 md:py-28 bg-white border-b border-stone-200/80">
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		
		<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 mb-10 sm:mb-16">
			<span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
				<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#5ad01f]"></span>
				How It Works
			</span>
			<h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-stone-900 leading-snug sm:leading-tight">
				The Process
			</h2>
			<p class="text-stone-600 text-base sm:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
				Starting therapy is a significant step. Here is what you can expect from the very first contact.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
			{steps.map((step) => (
				<div class="relative flex flex-col justify-between p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl bg-[#faf9f6] border border-stone-200/80 hover:border-emerald-300 transition-all duration-300 shadow-2xs">
					<div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
						<div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-emerald-800">
							{step.number}
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-stone-900">
							{step.title}
						</h3>
						<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-light">
							{step.description}
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>

		<!-- Quotes / Practice Ethos Box in Forest/Emerald Palette -->
		<div class="mt-10 sm:mt-16 bg-emerald-950 text-white rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
			<div class="absolute -right-12 -bottom-12 w-64 h-64 bg-[#5ad01f]/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
				<div class="inline-block text-[#5ad01f] text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">
					Client-Centred Philosophy
				</div>

				<p class="text-emerald-100 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
					As a person-centred counsellor, I do not believe in one-size-fits-all solutions. Our therapy will be uniquely shaped around who you are, what you value, and what you need at this moment in your life.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>
</section>
